      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-05-27T15:07:49.000Z",
      "title": "APLLTD: US Generics Pipeline And Leadership Transition Will Shape Balanced Future Prospects",
      "body": "The analyst fair value estimate for Alembic Pharmaceuticals has been revised from ₹845.0 to ₹715.0. Analysts attribute this change to updated assumptions that combine slightly lower revenue growth and a lower future P/E with a higher projected profit margin. What's in the News Alembic received USFDA tentative approval for Darolutamide Tablets, 300 mg, a generic version of Nubeqa used in several prostate cancer indications, with an estimated market size of US$3.155b for the twelve months ending March 2026 according to IQVIA (company announcement).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-aplltd/alembic-pharmaceuticals-shares/w8sw8s6g-regulatory-scrutiny-and-supply-issues-will-squeeze-pharma-prospects/updates/6-the-analyst-fair-value-estimate-for-alembic-pharmaceuticals",
