      "date": "2026-05-18T08:16:45.000Z",
      "title": "The Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited (NSE:APLLTD) Annual Results Are Out And Analysts Have Published New Forecasts",
      "body": "Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited ( NSE:APLLTD ) came out with its full-year results last week, and we wanted to see how...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-aplltd/alembic-pharmaceuticals-shares/news/the-alembic-pharmaceuticals-limited-nseaplltd-annual-results",
      "raw_subtype": "article"
    },
    {
      "id": "16a5e306-fc69-4510-86f2-c53c23e8cf57",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-18T07:44:59.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS in line with expectations, revenues disappoint",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹34.33 (up from ₹29.68 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹74.0b (up 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹6.75b (up 16% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.1% (up from 8.7% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) were mostly in line with analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.7% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 11% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 13% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
