      "title": "APLLTD: Expanding US Generic Portfolio And First Branded Launch Will Drive Upside",
      "body": "Analysts now place Alembic Pharmaceuticals' fair value at ₹939.9, about ₹10 lower than the prior ₹949.9 view. This reflects updated assumptions around slightly different revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E inputs.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nse-aplltd/alembic-pharmaceuticals-shares/qkdv5nue-us-product-launches-and-india-execution-will-expand-reach-atn3/updates/13-analysts-now-place-alembic-pharmaceuticals-fair-value-at-indian-rupee9",
